  - "P\u0159e\u017Eij 2 kola v \u0159ad\u011B jako skr\xFDva\u010D."
  - Saklanan olarak art arda 2 turda hayatta kal.
  - "Supravie\u021Buie\u0219te 2 runde la r\xE2nd ca ascuns."
  - "S\u1ED1ng s\xF3t 2 v\xE1n li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp khi l\xE0m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tr\u1ED1n."
